{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act29side_level_act29side_07_end",
  "groupId": "act29side",
  "stageId": "act29side_07",
  "title": "協奏曲“復活”",
  "storyCode": "ZT-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act29side/level_act29side_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b8672d0d92e258ac5eebcb49645b7bcdd073e3be068202168c18a3dfdfd3d897",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "憲……醫生很快就過來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳、咳咳……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薇薇安娜，你在哭嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我好像沒有力氣為你擦眼淚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，真是個太過敏感、太過善良的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我常常想起我們第一次見面的情形……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我從崔林特爾梅趕到施彤領，把你從沃爾納的高塔接出來。你縮在車後座，緊緊抱著並不大的行李箱，頭輕輕靠在我的胸口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她在害怕離開父親嗎？咳，她在對接下來卡西米爾的異鄉生活感到恐懼嗎？我當時這麼想著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但薇薇安……你只是試圖壓低身子，以免自己引人注目的角被看見，暴露行蹤，為沃爾納帶去麻煩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其實當時已是後半夜，偌大的選帝侯高塔群，沒有誰會察覺到一輛車的離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咳，你當時還那麼小……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不記得了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，你記得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "孩子，你可以抱怨、可以責怪、可以失望、可以後悔、可以憤恨，咳，你都可以……然後才能……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我真的不想……您離開……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我只有您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "讓我……再好好“看一看”你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡，我在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真慶幸，我看不清你現在的表情……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "珂拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你值得過上更好的生活，薇薇安娜……如果真有的話……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女皇塔再高，也不至於沒有盡頭。\n旋梯在眼前鋪開，但方向似乎被未知而不可逆的力量撕扯，她明明一直在前進，卻始終停留在原地。\n薇薇安娜有些疲憊，而人在疲憊時更容易察覺到自己的失去。\n……就像她二十二年的人生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你怎麼了，是迷路了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薇薇安娜抬起頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那是一個年輕的卡普里尼女性。她看著自己，臉上寫滿好奇和關切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也怪我跑得太急，撞到了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒有關係。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，你的臉色很差，還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是，在想一些事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您對這裡很熟悉嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯嗯，我就住在這附近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那請問，前面究竟通向哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，你不是自己來的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一條路通向哪裡，完全取決於你想去哪裡啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫柔的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了你小心點，我得走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想去哪裡……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薇薇安娜的手指撫過身側的扶手，厚厚的灰塵下，赭紅色的漆覆蓋住烏提卡家族的紋樣，鮮豔得彷彿是昨天才剛刷上去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "巫王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她想起讀過的那本歷史小說《餘燼》。\n巫王即位之初，交給了匠人們一張圖紙，上面畫著一座萊塔尼亞前所未有的巍峨巨構——“始源之塔”。\n單單看圖紙，就彷彿正站在它的基座前喘不過氣來。\n巫王對始源之塔的要求極其嚴苛，細緻到了每一根欄杆的用料和上漆，它們必須保證永不褪色。\n它將是萊塔尼亞的唯一象徵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎麼回事，“始源之角”已經完全降臨？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可剛剛那位女士……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薇薇安娜猛然反應了過來。\n剛剛經過的卡普里尼，像是崔林特爾梅外城區最常見的那種年輕人，正是充滿活力的年紀，忙碌但不知疲倦，聲音裡有一杯新茶的熱氣。\n無論是在女皇塔，還是“始源之角”，她都不應該出現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薇薇安娜連忙回望，可對方早已失去了蹤影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薇薇安娜，那麼你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你為什麼出現在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你為什麼回到萊塔尼亞？當年又為什麼會離開？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "階梯依然在延伸……某個不起眼的拐角，薇薇安娜突然看見了一扇門。\n那扇她再熟悉不過的，小小的門。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇薇安娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘗試在每個連接處左轉，以連續偏離方向來保證前進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "失敗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘗試下行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "四十五分鐘，仍未回到旋梯的底端。失敗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "費德里科已經在女皇塔的旋梯上耗費了相當長的時間，又一次突破失敗後，他停下了腳步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "從原理上說，法術是一種更為嚴謹的秩序。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "雙子女皇不會起用罹患精神疾病的設計師來設計高塔，也沒有工匠能將這樣毫無章法的建築結構還原出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在路德維格大學奏鳴塔的經歷誤導了我的判斷……女皇塔內部正在發生的扭曲與術式無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“始源之角”已經覆蓋住了女皇塔，引發了空間異變？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿爾圖羅的琴聲也已經消失……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "費德里科稍作思索，隨即拔出守護銃，向著身前射擊。\n銃的嘯聲響徹整個空間，但子彈本身卻似乎被無形之物抹去了……它們消失在了眼前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那邊的薩科塔先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "聲音響起的瞬間，費德里科又看見了那幾顆銃彈。它們的移動軌跡緩慢而清晰，像是石子漂過水面。漣漪擴散，水下的一切逐漸浮現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請你把銃收起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請你把銃收起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不用複述，我已經聽清了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本次任務中遇到的每個人都在強調這件事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為這是一件不需要強調的事情呀……崔林特爾梅和拉特蘭不一樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "洛里斯以前老講拉特蘭的事情。他說薩科塔走在街道上，遇到討厭的建築會“炸一炸”，遇到喜歡的建築，會更迫不及待地“炸一炸”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我和揚還一直覺得他只是因為對家鄉印象不太好，所以老愛編些瞎話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總之，請看看周圍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "崔林特爾梅是一座古城，可能某面牆某片瓦上，就有百年前某位藝術家喝醉後用法術刻上去的樂譜或者詩歌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "周圍……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "費德里科很快適應了眼前的異象。\n假定此地即是“始源之角”，儲存“巫王遺產”的所在，即阿爾圖羅的最終目的地。\n那他不會認為銃彈足以擊碎某種壁障，將自己從那古怪的旋梯帶到這裡。\n費德里科看著面前的女性。她面色慍怒，真的像一個制止遊客沒水準行為的正義市民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩科塔先生，不知道你能不能理解……請把銃收起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "容許我打斷一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們顯然並不是身處崔林特爾梅的街頭，但你似乎毫無察覺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "以及，你剛才提到的“洛里斯”和“揚”，如果全名為“洛里斯·博爾丁”和“揚·許勒爾”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "請告知我你的姓名和身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "著急的女性",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "尤利婭……尤利婭·許勒爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡是……“始源之角”內部，巫王的死後之地？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是巫王……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別東張西望了，小薩科塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您追上來了……我並不意外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵呵，倒是你，竟然敢攀著巫妖的絲線主動被“放逐”……真是給了我不少驚喜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……巫王在哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "死透了。不然呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我應該能感受到他。他的法術、他的情感、他的意志……只要我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿爾圖羅環顧四周，在這個空間裡，邊界彷彿並不存在，唯有種種難以名狀的光影在流動，彷彿混沌開翕時的呼吸。\n她將提琴立穩，手指輕輕按上琴弦，扣上琴弓，拉動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "寂靜。\n弓與弦相交，卻沒有任何聲音發出來。這個她無比熟稔與自然的動作，在這一刻突然失去了意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，看起來你終於有所察覺了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我無法演奏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我丟失了……我的樂聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是“始源之角”的緣故？還是巫王設下的“規則”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "狂妄。愚蠢。白癡。你頭頂的光環除了讓膚色看起來更白些，就沒有讓你的腦子更靈光一點嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你以為這裡是什麼地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫爾昏佐倫的棺材？薩爾貢那些走路漏沙的帕夏的藏寶窟？維多利亞童話裡老巫婆的魔法口袋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "弗萊蒙特閣下……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（薩卡茲語）“千絲萬弦之始終”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "像是喃喃自語，弗萊蒙特用薩卡茲語吐出了一個異常生澀的詞彙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又或者，用那傢伙起的名字，更符合你們的認知能力一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（萊塔尼亞語）“荒域”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "荒域……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你所見的，是“實在”的另一面，空間的另一個維度，它永恆變化，所有的規則和現實都將在被它碰觸到的瞬間湮滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "巫妖一族在漫長的時間裡對其不過一窺。而赫爾昏佐倫窮盡畢生之力，也只是在這無盡的混沌裡吹出了這樣一個不穩定的泡泡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿爾圖羅沒有回應弗萊蒙特的憤怒。她再次扣了扣琴弦，提琴依然沉默著。\n沒有失望，沒有恐懼，唯有疑惑。\n強烈的疑惑在阿爾圖羅的臉上稍縱即逝。隨後，她抬起頭來，向著對方微笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "巫王並不是依靠什麼秘法延續了自己的意志，而是在荒域中建起了自己的“行宮”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這片空間是真實存在的，他也一定就在這個地方……只是我需要再走一段路，才能抵達他的王座。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你知道，在荒域中再次被“放逐”，會發生什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陰影在生長……阿爾圖羅猛然警覺。\n在自己說話時，對方已經施放了巫術。以弗萊蒙特為圓心，那些絲弦般的陰影膨脹成粗壯的藤蔓，融進本就色彩曖昧的地面，蔓延過來。\n腐朽的氣息開枝散葉，它最飽滿的形態，即是死亡與消逝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我還沒有得到答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我必須找回我的樂聲，我必須，演奏巫王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我還不能……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "……死去。\n她願意在演奏的同時走向終點，卻無法接受自己消散在真相面前，寂靜之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "陰影在一瞬間裂開，灰色的雨逆流而上，包裹了一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巫王的樂手",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "維恩大鐘樓響了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巫王的樂手",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快走吧，去始源之塔，演奏就要開始了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巫王的樂手",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "新的樂曲，新的術式……為維杜尼亞抵禦天災和高盧人的火炮……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巫王的樂手",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "赫爾……赫爾昏佐倫……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……這裡的時空並不穩定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是“放逐”誘發的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，早在我們進入荒域之前就這樣了。赫爾昏佐倫的力量正在衰減。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "弗萊蒙特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“始源之角”……在加速崩塌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……還活著？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "剛剛的旋律……又消失了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她抓住了那一縷不同於周遭環境的聲響，拼命逃脫了“放逐”的絲線。\n而此刻那旋律化作了實體，從混沌中清晰地析出，落到她跟前。\n變成了……一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（混亂不清的聲響）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您……是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是您奏出了剛才的旋律，救了我……一命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（混亂不清的聲響）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您是隨侍在巫王身側的……高塔術師嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤利婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "巫、巫王！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤利婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我怎麼可能和他有這麼大牽扯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤利婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，小心，別多說話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤利婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有人在追你嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤利婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你受傷了……別亂跑，先在這裡躲一會兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尤利婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心，這附近我很熟悉，沒人能找過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
